  "rationale": "The chart documents active type 2 diabetes mellitus (assessment: currently active, HbA1c 8.2%) and active chronic kidney disease stage 3. ICD-10-CM guidelines presume a causal relationship for combination code E11.22; no documentation states the conditions are unrelated. Both conditions are confirmed active, supporting the combination code.",
